OL,3,AUS House to vote on moving forward with
OL,4,AHegseth impeachment
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS lawmakers are weighing whether to
OL,7,Fsupport a Republican congressman's
OL,8,Fattempt to impeach Defence Secretary
OL,9,FPete Hegseth
OL,11,FThey will vote later on Tuesday to
OL,12,Fdecide if the House of Representatives
OL,13,Fshould move forward on Thomas Massie's
OL,14,Fmeasure accusing Hegseth of waging war
OL,15,Fon Iran without congressional
OL,16,Fauthorisation - but today's vote does
OL,17,Fnot officially decide on impeachment
OL,19,FSpeaking at the Pentagon for the first
OL,20,Ftime in six months, the defence
OL,21,Fsecretary called the impeachment effort
OL,22,Fa "farce" and added: "This is sabotage"
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
